{"schema":1,"technical_reference":"96f95e015af9f5f38e4a8aefca7cab29a78b030d","files":[{"path":"src/pokemon.c","before_sha256":"12303f2d747e49ff00aed0f6e9bb2b7b1b83b660cc90a709688f18acbf50adc4","after_sha256":"6229dd143ab189e620e9fb6b15d120ad1c053590cbcfc13da81789741834579c","remove":false,"lines":[{"span":[0,5027]},{"port":"/*\n"},{"port":" * Twin Embers: the evolutions that need a trade also happen on levelling up from level 40, with no trade and no item.\n"},{"port":" * Holding the trade's item picks that branch: Clamperl becomes Huntail, or Gorebyss with the Deep Sea Scale. A\n"},{"port":" * species that already evolves by level (Slowpoke) keeps doing so; it takes the trade branch (Slowking) only while\n"},{"port":" * holding the item, once it could evolve. Cross-generation targets still wait for the National Pokédex, as in a trade.\n"},{"port":" */\n"},{"port":"#define CTR_TRADE_EVO_LEVEL 40\n"},{"port":"\n"},{"port":"static u16 CtrEvo_TradeByLevel(u16 species, u8 level, u16 heldItem, u16 targetSpecies)\n"},{"port":"{\n"},{"port":"    int i;\n"},{"port":"    bool8 byLevel = FALSE;\n"},{"port":"    u16 trade = SPECIES_NONE;\n"},{"port":"\n"},{"port":"    for (i = 0; i < EVOS_PER_MON; i++)\n"},{"port":"        if (gEvolutionTable[species][i].method == EVO_LEVEL)\n"},{"port":"            byLevel = TRUE;\n"},{"port":"    for (i = 0; i < EVOS_PER_MON; i++)\n"},{"port":"    {\n"},{"port":"        const struct Evolution *evo = &gEvolutionTable[species][i];\n"},{"port":"\n"},{"port":"        if (evo->method == EVO_TRADE_ITEM && evo->param == heldItem\n"},{"port":"         && (byLevel ? targetSpecies != SPECIES_NONE : level >= CTR_TRADE_EVO_LEVEL))\n"},{"port":"        {\n"},{"port":"            trade = evo->targetSpecies;\n"},{"port":"            break;\n"},{"port":"        }\n"},{"port":"        if ((evo->method == EVO_TRADE || (evo->method == EVO_TRADE_ITEM && !byLevel))\n"},{"port":"         && level >= CTR_TRADE_EVO_LEVEL && trade == SPECIES_NONE)\n"},{"port":"            trade = evo->targetSpecies;\n"},{"port":"    }\n"},{"port":"    if (trade != SPECIES_NONE && (IsNationalPokedexEnabled() || trade <= KANTO_SPECIES_END))\n"},{"port":"        return trade;\n"},{"port":"    return targetSpecies;\n"},{"port":"}\n"},{"port":"\n"},{"span":[5027,88]},{"port":"        targetSpecies = CtrEvo_TradeByLevel(species, level, heldItem, targetSpecies);\n"},{"span":[5115,1361]}]}]}
